WEBVTT

00:10:31.050 --> 00:11:07.026
☆David wanted to learn a new language but was not sure which one. So, last weekend, he went to the language section of a bookstore. He had an idea. He would learn the language of the first book he picked without looking. He closed his eyes and reached for a book. It was a Korean language book. David chose two other related books and was ready to learn Korean.
☆☆Question: What did David do last weekend?
